--- !u!114 &257946848
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 257946846}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e50ba17086dd0d441b315907b988fb9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  manager: {fileID: 1823232039}
  lines:
  - "Hey! Name\u2019s Jax\u2026 your friendly neighborhood room operator guy. Don\u2019t
    worry, I only bite sometimes."
  - "So\u2026 someone forgot to turn off the gravity machine. Yep, classic first-day
    mess."
  - "See that machine on top of the dome? Yeah\u2026 the one making that super annoying
    noise."
  - "Just go up there, turn it off, and we\u2019ll pretend none of this ever happened."
  - "And after that\u2026 yeah, the aircraft\u2019s still broken. Surprise"
  - Go find some tools for that hat guy, the aircraft engineer, I mean.
  - "If I don\u2019t get those tools to them, they gonna complain to me every single
    day."
  - "So yeah\u2026 do me a favor, grab the tools and let them deal with their stuff."
  - "And yeah\u2026 good luck with the cave operator. You\u2019re gonna need it"
  voices:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 190e7c9e7911c0d4ab4dde250f1c82b2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd40e1edce6527b42a752ffbc9619ea9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0faa9842a4a912f478455d119359b8ea, type: 3}
